    "description": "<p>The Obsidian Armories T12 Total Security Armor is a purpose-built protective armor designed for riot control, breaching, and heavy weapons duties. Its comprehensive protective features are enough for it to be noticeably cumbersome and unwieldy, but its protection from common security threats is unmatched. While seen among law enforcement, it is usually used by security forces when powered armor is too unwieldy or risky to utilize.</p>",
